00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.050
- Welcome back.

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:03.810
All hour, we have celebrated
how powerful music can be

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.000
in our lives, releasing interviews

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.220
from musicians we've never aired before.

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.540
Now I wanna share some music

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.150
from an emerging artist who's
all about using their songs

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:13.890
to advocate for others.

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:16.920
They've been featured in
Billboard and Rolling Stone,

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.544
